FORMAT: 1A
HOST:https://gconvertrest.sendmsg.co.il/api/Sendmsg/

# Sendmsg API 4.0 

The Sendmsg Api is a simple API that allows managing and creating mailing lists, newsletters and sending SMS campaigns.

#API Support

#####Support Request Will Only Be Accepted In The Proper Template

Link:
<br><a href="https://gconvertrest.sendmsg.co.il/views/apisupport.html">Template For Support Request</a>

+ Copy The Template to Your mail 
+ Fill The Template With The Requested Data
+ Send The Mail To : send.help@comstar.co.il

#About SMS
SMS can be sent by this api

##### Paramater Restrictions:(SenderPhone)
* Any special character or spaces will be deleted.
* Any word over 11 characters will be trimmed.
* Letters can be only in english


# Status Codes

| Code       |Info                   |
|:-----------|-----------------------|
| 200 Or 10000        | Success               | 
|200 > * && *<300    |Success with message in the result  |
|410        |Did not find what you were looking for    |
|500        |An error occurred    |
|530        |Please Try again later   |
|531        |Success to insert But not in sending the message   |
|550        |An error occurred during data extraction. Please Try again later   |

##Every status code returns with details at the "ResultMessage" value.

# Important

+ You should send the string as <b>UTF-8</b>.
  <br>Necessary in working with the Hebrew language.
+ <b><u>PHP:</u></b> content-length is required.<br>
  length of the json in the Body of the request.

## Getting started [/token]
To start using our API, you need your account SiteID and API Password.

SiteID is your Sendmsg account number.

You can get your accounts' API Password by mailing our support team - send.help@comstar.co.il

After gathering all the information - it's time to get a token:
### Click here to get token! [POST]
* After receiving the token - 
* The token should be added to the header when the key is "Authorization" in every single method used.
* The Token valid for 12 hour.
We recommend renewing a token in a short time

Example:
![name](https://gconvertrest.sendmsg.co.il/exampleHeader.PNG)
| Paramater |Info                  | type    | 
|:----------|----------------------|---------|
| SiteID    | Account number        |number      |      
|Password   |Get from support           |string  | 

You can request the token data (like timestamp or expiry date) using this route (POST) -
 https://gconvertrest.sendmsg.co.il/api/sendMsg/token/?full=true
 
 
 + Request (application/json)

           {
            "siteID": 1687,
            "password" : "0123456789"
        }
         

+ Response 200 (application/json)
        
  + Body
  
             {
             "Token": "34234-34234234-fsdgdfg-34r5t343f334f"
             }
        


## Test Authentication [/ping]

### Test authentication[POST]

    + Headers
    
             Authorization: 34234-34234234-fsdgdfg-34r5t343f334f


+ Response 200 (application/json)
  
        
        {
         "isSuccess": true,
          "msg": "hello user: 11111 test works! you are now validated.."
        }
        


## Add Or Update Users [/AddUsersOnly]

You can add or update  subscribers to your account by sending a json with the subcscribers details.

#### Users Json Object Option


#### User Json Object By Email

| Variable Name     |Fill Required|Info                  |exmple value       |
|:------------------|------------|-----------------------|-------------------|
| EmailAddress    |yes|Subscriber Email                |comstar@comstar.com|
| Cellphone|no |Subscriber Cellphone number      |0500000000|
| FirstName|no |The system will try to find one personal field in your account whose name is 'first name', if it finds one, the information will be entered there      |First Name Client|
| LastName|no |The system will try to find one personal field in your account whose name is 'last name', if it finds one, the information will be entered there      |Last Name Client|
| userSystemFields  |no         |Array Of Customer fields on SendMSG|'userSystemFields': [{<br>'Key': 'company name',<br>'Value': 'comstar'<br>}]|



#### User Json Object By UserID  

| Variable Name     |Fill Required|Info                  |exmple value       |
|:------------------|------------|-----------------------|-------------------|
| UserID    |yes|UserID number From Sendmsg Account |19407|
| Cellphone|no |Subscriber Cellphone number      |0500000000|
| FirstName|no |The system will try to locate one personal field whose name is 'first name', if it finds one, the information will be entered there      |First Name Client|
| LastName|no |The system will try to find one personal field in your account whose name is 'last name', if it finds one, the information will be entered there      |Last Name Client|
| userSystemFields  |no         |Array Of Custome field on SendMSG|'userSystemFields': [{<br>'Key': 'company name',<br>'Value': 'comstar'<br>}]|


# Example: 

Please take a look at the Brackets in the [MessageContent].
This is will be one of your fields and will be replace on rendering.
if key will not match, it will be removed.
to Create a new field, please use  the [CreateField method]

### body 

```json
{
  "users": [
    {
      "EmailAddress": "comstar@comstar.com",
      "Cellphone": "050111111",
      //"FirstName": "Client First Name",
      //"LastName": "Client Last Name",
    },
  ],
  "Message": {
    "MessageContent": "Hello [companyName]",
  }
}
```

 <u><b>Comment:</b></u><br>
 + If UserID and Email apper Together and they are init with veriable the result will return base on the Email


### Add Or Update Users By Email [POST]

+ Request 1 (application/json)

   + Headers
    
            Authorization: 34234-34234234-fsdgdfg-34r5t343f334f

    + Body
    
   
            [
             { 
             "EmailAddress": "comstar@comstar.com", 
             "Cellphone": "0501234567",
             "FirstName":"Client First Name",
             "LastName":"Client Last Name",
             "userSystemFields": [
                                  {
                                   "Key": "Custome Field Name In Sendmsg",
                                   "Value": "Value" 
                                  },
                                  {
                                   "Key": "Custome Field Name In Sendmsg",
                                   "Value": "Value" 
                                  }
                                 ]
             }
            ]

+ Response 200 (application/json)

    + Body
 
 
            {
            "success": true-Or-false,
            "res": true-Or-false,
            "result": {
                       "ResultID": Status-Code,
                       "ResultMessage": SendMsgResult-Message,
                       "Tin": deprecated-always-empty 
                    },
            "data": {
                     "users": [user Count],
                     "message": Massage ID
                    }
             }


