## Add Users to Maling Lists [/AddUsersToLists]


add users to an existing mailing list.

####Post Request Body Objects

#####Users Json Object Options

####+User Json Object By Email

| Variable Name     |Fill Required|Info                  |exmple value       |
|:------------------|------------|-----------------------|-------------------|
| EmailAddress    |yes|Subscriber Email                |comstar@comstar.com|


####+User Json Object By UserID

| Variable Name     |Fill Required|Info                  |exmple value       |
|:------------------|------------|-----------------------|-------------------|
| UserID    |yes|UserID number From Sendmsg Account |19407|




####Mailing Lists Array Json

#####+Existing List ID Json Object
| Variable Name     |Fill Required|Info                  |exmple value       |
|:------------------|------------|-----------------------|-------------------|
| ExistingListID    |yes |Array of MailingList ID(int) From Sendmsg Account |19407|


### Add Users By Email to Maling Lists [POST]

+ Request 1 (application/json)

    + Headers
    
            Authorization: 34234-34234234-fsdgdfg-34r5t343f334f


    + Body
    
    
            {
            "users": 
                    [ 
                     { 
                      "EmailAddress": "comstar@comstar.com"
                     } 
                    ],
            "mailingLists":
                           [ 
                            {
                             "ExistingListID": 5 
                            }
                           ]
            }

+ Response 200 (application/json)


   + Body
 
 
            {
            "success": true-Or-false,
            "res": true-Or-false,
            "result": {
                       "ResultID": Status-Code,
                       "ResultMessage": SendMsgResult-Message,
                       "Tin": deprecated-always-empty 
                    },
            "data": {
                     "users": [array - userID],
                     "mailingLists": [array - mailingLists ID]
                    }
             }


### Add Users By UserID to Maling Lists [POST]

+ Request 2 (application/json)

    + Headers
    
            Authorization: 34234-34234234-fsdgdfg-34r5t343f334f

    + Body
    
    
            { 
            "users": 
               [ 
                { 
                 "UserID": 19407
                } 
              ],
            "mailingLists":
                [ 
                 {
                  "ExistingListID": 5 
                 }
                ] 
            }

+ Response 200 (application/json)


   + Body
 
 
            {
            "success": true-Or-false,
            "res": true-Or-false,
            "result": {
                       "ResultID": Status-Code,
                       "ResultMessage": SendMsgResult-Message,
                       "Tin": deprecated-always-empty 
                    },
            "data": {
                     "users": [array - userID],
                     "mailingLists": [array - mailingLists ID]
                    }
             }


## Add Users and Send Email [/AddUsersAndSend]

You can add or update subscribers to your account by sending a json with the subcscribers details.
and a Email Message details. 


### Post Request Body Objects

#### Users Json Object Options

#### User Json Object By Email

| Variable Name     |Fill Required|Info                  |exmple value       |
|:------------------|------------|-----------------------|-------------------|
| EmailAddress    |yes|Subscriber Email                |comstar@comstar.com|
| Cellphone|no |Subscriber Cellphone number      |0500000000|
| FirstName|no |The system will try to locate one personal field whose name is 'first name', if it finds one, the information will be entered there      |First Name Client|
| LastName|no |The system will try to find one personal field in your account whose name is 'last name', if it finds one, the information will be entered there      |Last Name Client|
| userSystemFields  |no         |Array Of Custome field on SendMSG|'userSystemFields': [{<br>'Key': 'company name',<br>'Value': 'comstar'<br>}] <br> full example below|
| userSendFields  |no         |Array Of data field on this msg|'userSendFields': [{<br>'Key': 'company name',<br>'Value': 'comstar'<br>}] <br> full example below<br><b>Supports simple emojis (UTF-8 only - excluding utf8mb4)</b>|



# MessageContent Example: 

Please take a look at the Brackets in the [MessageContent].
This is will be one of your fields and will be replace on rendering.
if key will not match, it will be removed.
to Create a new field, please use  the [CreateField method]

### body 

```json
{
  "users": [
    {
      "EmailAddress": "comstar@comstar.com",
      "Cellphone": "050111111",
      //"FirstName": "Client First Name",
      //"LastName": "Client Last Name",
    },
  ],
  "Message": {
    "MessageContent": "Hello [companyName]",
  }
}
```

# userSendFields Example:

key example:  [|[your key]|]
<br/><b>Supports simple emojis (UTF-8 only - excluding utf8mb4)</b><br/>
for using userSendFields, please take a  look at the example,

```json
{
  "users": [
    {
      "EmailAddress": "example@comstar.com",
      "userSendFields":[{
        "Key":"companyName",
        "Value":"comstar"
}]
    }
  ],
  "Message": {
    "MessageContent": "Your [|[companyName]|] Name ",
    "MessageSubject": "hello world",
    "SenderEmailAddress": "office@comstar.co.il",
    "SenderName": "comstar",
    "MessageBackColor": "black",
    "MessageDirection": 2,
    "MessageInnerName": "inner name",
    "AddFacebook": true,
    "AddForward": true,
    "AddShowMessage": true
  }
}
```

#### User Json Object By UserID

| Variable Name     |Fill Required|Info                  |exmple value       |
|:------------------|------------|-----------------------|-------------------|
| UserID    |yes|UserID number From Sendmsg Account |19407|
| Cellphone|no |Subscriber Cellphone number      |0500000000|
| FirstName|no |The system will try to locate one personal field whose name is 'first name', if it finds one, the information will be entered there      |First Name Client|
| LastName|no |The system will try to find one personal field in your account whose name is 'last name', if it finds one, the information will be entered there      |Last Name Client|
| userSystemFields  |no         |Array Of Custome field on SendMSG|'userSystemFields': [{<br>'Key': 'company name',<br>'Value': 'comstar'<br>}] |
| userSendFields  |no         |Array Of data field on this msg|'userSendFields': [{<br>'Key': 'company name',<br>'Value': 'comstar'<br>}] <br> full example below<br><b>Supports simple emojis (UTF-8 only - excluding utf8mb4)</b>|



### Message Json Object

#### New Message Object

| Variable Name     |Fill Required|Info                  |exmple value       |Default if not Using|
|:------------------|------------|-----------------------|-------------------|--------------------|
| MessageContent    |yes   |Content Of The Massage|Hello World|none|
| MessageSubject    |yes   |Subject Of Message| HeadLine|none|
| MessageInnerName  |yes   |Name of Massage <br>(in sendmsg account)|MassageName|none|
| SenderEmailAddress|no    |Email|test@sendmsg.co.il|comstar@sendmsg.co.il|
| MessageBackColor  |no    |Can be set by Hex Color|#fcba03|#ffffff - Black|
| MessageDirection  |yes   | RTL=1 <br>Or<br> LTR=2 |1|none|
| AddFacebook       |no    |Add a Share Link of Mail<br>to Facebook<br>(Link to Share the mail on Social Madia)|true|false|
| AddForward        |no    |Add a Link To Forward the Mail|true|false|
| AddShowMessage    |no    |Add a Link To view the Mail <br>on the Browser|true|false|

#####+Past Message Object


| Variable Name     |Fill Required|Info                  |exmple value       |
|:------------------|------------|-----------------------|-------------------|
| MessageID    |yes   |ID Number of Massage <br>from History of all Massages Sent |2050763|

#####+Draft Message Object


| Variable Name     |Fill Required|Info                  |exmple value       |
|:------------------|------------|-----------------------|-------------------|
| UseDraftID    |yes   |ID Number of Massage <br>from Drafts Massage's|2050763|



### Add Users and Send New Email  [POST]

+ Request 1 (application/json)

   + Headers
    
            Authorization: 34234-34234234-fsdgdfg-34r5t343f334f

    + Body


            {
             "users":[
                     {
                     "EmailAddress": "comstar@comstar.com",
                     "Cellphone" : "050111111",
                     "FirstName": "Client First Name",
                     "LastName": "Client Last Name",
                     },
                     {
                     "EmailAddress": "comstar@gmail.com",
                     "Cellphone" : "0502222222",
                     "FirstName": "Client First Name",
                     "LastName": "Client Last Name",
                     }
                    ],
             "Message":
                     {
                      "MessageContent":"this is the content of the message",
                      "MessageSubject":"hello world",
                      "SenderEmailAddress":"office@comstar.co.il",
                      "SenderName": "comstar",
                      "MessageBackColor":"black",
                      "MessageDirection":2,
                      "MessageInnerName":"inner name",
                      "AddFacebook": true,
                      "AddForward": true,
                      "AddShowMessage":true
                     }
            }

+ Response 200 (application/json)
 
    
    + Body
 
 
            {
            "success": true-Or-false,
            "res": true-Or-false,
            "result": {
                       "ResultID": Status-Code,
                       "ResultMessage": SendMsgResult-Message,
                       "Tin": deprecated-always-empty 
                    },
            "data": {
                     "users": [user Count],
                     "message": Massage ID
                    }
             }


