## Create message [/CreateMessage]


####Message Json Object
#####New Message Object


| Variable Name     |Fill Required|Info                  |exmple value       |Default if not Using|
|:------------------|------------|-----------------------|-------------------|--------------------|
| MessageContent    |yes   |Content Of The Massage|Hello World|none|
| MessageSubject    |yes   |Subject Of Message| HeadLine|none|
| MessageInnerName  |yes   |Name of Massage <br>(in sendmsg account)|MassageName|none|
| SenderEmailAddress|no    |Email|test@sendmsg.co.il|comstar@sendmsg.co.il|
| MessageBackColor  |no    |Can be set by Hex Color|#fcba03|#ffffff - White|
| MessageDirection  |yes   | RTL=1 <br>Or<br> LTR=2 |1|none|
| AddFacebook       |no    |Add a Share Link of Mail<br>to Facebook<br>(Link to Share the mail on Social Madia)|true|false|
| AddForward        |no    |Add a Link To Forward the Mail|true|false|
| AddShowMessage    |no    |Add a Link To view the Mail <br>on the Browser|true|false|
| PostponeSendTime    |no    |Scheduling the send for a future date|2030-02-25|NOW|


