## sms regulations

## Get Verification Code By SMS  [/VerificationOfSenderNumberBySMS]

For the purpose of sending a message by a personal mobile number.
we require you to provide a valid phone number To make sure that your information is accurate and up-to-date, 
 we may require that you verify your phone number via SMS text or phone call by two steps. 
 
 1. add the phone number on panel.sendmsg.co.il
 2. post to our API to verify your phone number
 
### Get Verification Code By SMS [POST]

+ Request


    + Headers
    
             Authorization: 34234-34234234-fsdgdfg-34r5t343f334f

    + body 
        
        {
        "SenderNumber":"0501231234",
        }
 

