## Get subscribers by timeline [/GetNumberOfJoinersToSystem]

### Get subscribers by timeline[POST]

+ Request Get Subscribers by Timeline

    + Headers

        Authorization: 34234-34234234-fsdgdfg-34r5t343f334f

    + Body

        ```
        [
            {
                "From": "2023-07-22 18:03:33",
                "Until": "2023-08-11 18:03:33"
            },
            {
                "From": "2023-07-02 18:03:34",
                "Until": "2023-07-22 18:03:34"
            }
        ]
        ```

+ Response 200 (application/json)

    ```
    {
        "success": true,
        "res": true,
        "result": {
            "ResultID": 200,
            "ResultMessage": "Passed OK",
            "Tin": ""
        },
        "SendMsgJoinersDate": [
            {
                "From": "2023-07-22T18:03:33",
                "Sum": 2,
                "Until": "2023-08-11T18:03:33"
            },
            {
                "From": "2023-07-02T18:03:34",
                "Sum": 1,
                "Until": "2023-07-22T18:03:34"
            }
        ]
    }
    ```




