## CreateField [/CreateField]

### CreateField [POST]

####<u><b>Usage:</b></u>
Create new Field in your account.

### options

| Type      | FieldUserInt  | description |
| ----------| ------------- | ------------|
| Text      | 1             |  |
| Yes/No    | 2             ||
| Dropdown  | 3             ||
| Date      | 4             ||
| Long text | 7             ||
| Number    | 8             |On using Dropdown field, using [OptionToDDR] is required|

#####<u><b>Input:</b></u>
<pre>
<code>
        {
        "FieldUserName":"Field Name",
        "FieldUserType": 1,
        }
</code>   
</pre>
#### On using Dropdown field, using [OptionToDDR] is required

Example:
<pre>
<code>
        {
        "FieldUserName":"Field Name",
        "FieldUserType": 3,
        "OptionToDDR":["item 1", "item 2", "item 3"]
        }
</code>   
</pre>
+ Response 200 (application/json)

            {
            "FieldName":"Field Name",
            "FieldType":1
            }
        
        


